Extract embedded cover art to folder.jpg for every release that has no cover file

Usage: extract-meta-images [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --root <ROOT>  Library root (defaults to MUSIC_DIR from web/.env)
  -o, --only <ONLY>  Only process these artists (semicolon-separated)
  -f, --from <FROM>  Start of the artist range
  -t, --to <TO>      End of the artist range
      --exact        Exact match for --only (no prefix matching)
      --dry-run      Preview what would be written without touching disk
      --web          Machine-readable progress output
  -h, --help         Print help
